  "pages": [
    {
      "name": "Rules",
      "type": "text",
      "text": {
        "content": "<h2>Monsters</h2>\n<p>Each monster entry lists armor class, hit dice, hit points, number appearing, movement, attacks, damage, special abilities, morale, treasure type and XP value. Hit dice are d8; a \"+\" adds hit points without changing the HD for attack or saving throw purposes.</p>\n<p>Monsters use the same descending AC and saving throw categories as characters. Special attacks such as breath weapons, poison, paralysis and charm usually allow a saving throw with a stated modifier. Treasure type determines the rolled treasure.</p>"
      },
      "_id": "OmIpXROi_y9ZSpjO",
      "_key": "!journal.pages!-lDQ-NiUJIi7lzHO.OmIpXROi_y9ZSpjO"
